<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P affirms BBB- long term rating on Fernz.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms BBB- long term rating on Fernz.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit ratings agency Standard and Poor's on Friday affirmed its BBB- long-term credit rating on Fernz Corporation New Zealand.</p>
<p>The company's short-term rating was affirmed at A-3.</p>
<p>The statement follows Fernz' announcement on Wednesday that it will sell its leading fertiliser manufacturing and distribution business in New Zealand to BOP Fertiliser Ltd and Ravensdown Fertiliser Cooperative Ltd.  </p>
<p>The statement made no reference to Fernz' announcement earlier on Friday that it has bought a 45.14 percent stake in French company CFPI, and that it plans to take over all of CFPI.</p>
</text>
